# logos-allowlist for the allocator: one public key per line, as reported by
# the tester's `allowlist_sign_module.identity` for logos-allowlist (`id`, 64 hex, the PoWClaim key of the
# tester's own logos-blockchain node, little-endian as the node prints it; a
# 0x prefix and uppercase are accepted and normalised). Lines starting with #
# and blank lines are ignored; other lines are dropped and logged. Each key is
# granted ONE membership (it is the vector's nullifier). Saving this file
# re-`serve`s the running allocator within ~30 s — no restart needed.
